Package: steward
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ambrus Fodor <ambrusfodor.online@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.7), 7zip | p7zip-full, pkexec | policykit-1
Suggests: flatpak, snapd
Conflicts: app-commander
Replaces: app-commander
Description: manage every installed application in one place
 Steward lists all installed applications regardless of how they were
 installed (apt, Flatpak, Snap, AppImage or hand-made launchers), shows where
 each desktop entry lives, and lets you launch, update or uninstall them.
 .
 It also installs and updates AppImages, and edits menu entries in place:
 name, icon, keywords, categories and command.
